tHand_MI.jpg", "size": 420715, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/60358433", "supplied_md5": "ffc2f0481e72c96d5c42697bab951e20", "computed_md5": "ffc2f0481e72c96d5c42697bab951e20", "mimetype": "image/jpeg"}, {"id": 60358436, "name": "Feedback_RightHand_MI.jpg", "size": 432846, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/60358436", "supplied_md5": "765af7c22ebc2bc5ddaf0261653c98d6", "computed_md5": "765af7c22ebc2bc5ddaf0261653c98d6", "mimetype": "image/jpeg"}, {"id": 66772196, "name": "sourcedata.zip", "size": 4894533454, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66772196", "supplied_md5": "a079fa4a6f3073e0ebb92102ade23731", "computed_md5": "a079fa4a6f3073e0ebb92102ade23731", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 66772193, "name": "derivatives.zip", "size": 2005900019, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66772193", "supplied_md5": "f9eff51ad9a3de6fad728b542804c73c", "computed_md5": "f9eff51ad9a3de6fad728b542804c73c", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 66878795, "name": "README.md", "size": 2502, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66878795", "supplied_md5": "accaf4a89cfd1486d38a375c343b42b9", "computed_md5": "accaf4a89cfd1486d38a375c343b42b9", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 66879068, "name": "Code.zip", "size": 201824, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66879068", "supplied_md5": "717c3c463bd25f72aa2c61eb529c4a86", "computed_md5": "717c3c463bd25f72aa2c61eb529c4a86", "mimetype": "application/zip"}, {"id": 66879071, "name": "fma_sessions.tsv", "size": 1095, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66879071", "supplied_md5": "5b9e8b6a07b0378cd0c4b58a5f74caf0", "computed_md5": "5b9e8b6a07b0378cd0c4b58a5f74caf0", "mimetype": "text/plain"}, {"id": 66960068, "name": "updateNotice.pdf", "size": 516476, "is_link_only": false, "download_url": "https://ndownloader.figshare.com/files/66960068", "supplied_md5": "01a11dabc6341b8ce60486a0069c8a50", "computed_md5": "01a11dabc6341b8ce60486a0069c8a50", "mimetype": "application/pdf"}], "folder_structure": {"60088460": "", "60088463": "", "60088466": "", "60088481": "", "60088484": "", "60088487": "", "60088490": "", "60088493": "", "60358418": "stimuli", "60358421": "stimuli", "60358424": "stimuli", "60358427": "stimuli", "60358430": "stimuli", "60358433": "stimuli", "60358436": "stimuli", "66772193": "", "66772196": "", "66878795": "", "66879068": "", "66879071": "", "66960068": ""}, "authors": [{"id": 22749023, "full_name": "Jian Luo", "first_name": "Jian", "last_name": "Luo", "is_active": true, "url_name": "Jian_Luo", "orcid_id": "0009-0001-7042-3549"}], "custom_fields": [], "figshare_url": "https://figshare.com/articles/dataset/HS_Stroke_dataset_an_upper-limb_motor_imagery_EEG_dataset_of_chronic_stroke_patients/30747806", "download_disabled": false, "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">The HS Stroke dataset contains motor imagery (MI) EEG recordings from chronic stroke patients. Each patient completed multiple recording sessions. Each trial lasted several seconds and consisted of three stages: a preparation stage, a MI stage, and a feedback stage. In the preparation stage, patients were instructed to relax. During the MI stage, patients imagined left- or right-hand wrist extension movements according to on-screen cues. In the feedback stage, if the imagined movement was correct, a virtual hand performed the corresponding action, providing visual feedback. EEG signals were recorded using a high-resolution EEG acquisition system.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">The dataset also includes pre- and post-training clinical and neurophysiological measures, including FMA, sEMG, and MEPs, providing complementary assessments of motor function and neural activity. All data are organized according to the EEG-BIDS standard, including experimental stimuli, EEG data and derivatives, patient information, and analysis code.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">With this dataset, we first examined the neurophysiological differences between left- and right-hand MI in stroke patients. Subsequently, we performed a binary classification task using baseline data and state-of-the-art methods. This result affirms the quality of the collected EEG signals and demonstrates their successful discriminability based on the execution of MI tasks. Exploratory analyses further showed that MI-related EEG features are significantly associated with FMA scores, indicating their relevance to motor recovery. We expect that this dataset will support future MI-BCI research and inform post-stroke rehabilitation strategies.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">We would like to express our gratitude to Zhiwei Deng from the University of Science & Technology of China for pointing out the existence of repeated trials across different runs. Following a thorough quality review, these duplicate trials within the same session have been excluded from the current release. Please note, however, that this issue does not exist across different sessions or subjects. The updated dataset contains 23,382 trials and 93,528 samples (with a 1-second window). We sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused if you have downloaded the previous version. A detailed update notice for the experiment results is provided in updateNotice.pdf.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 6, "status": "public", "size": 6903852376, "created_date": "2026-07-24T16:16:18Z", "modified_date": "2026-07-24T16:16:18Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["EEG", "Stroke", "Motor Imagery", "Brain Computer Interface in Rehabilitation"], "keywords": ["EEG", "Stroke", "Motor Imagery", "Brain Computer Interface in Rehabilitation"], "categories": [{"id": 24733, "title": "Central nervous system", "parent_id": 24724, "path": "/24457/24724/24733", "source_id": "320903", "taxonomy_id": 100}, {"id": 24739, "title": "Neurology and neuromuscular diseases", "parent_id": 24724, "path": "/24457/24724/24739", "source_id": "320905", "taxonomy_id": 100}, {"id": 29161, "title": "Deep learning", "parent_id": 29152, "path": "/28798/29152/29161", "source_id": "461103", "taxonomy_id": 100}, {"id": 27031, "title": "Rehabilitation", "parent_id": 27004, "path": "/27001/27004/27031", "source_id": "420109", "taxonomy_id": 100}, {"id": 30355, "title": "Clinical neuropsychology", "parent_id": 30352, "path": "/30292/30352/30355", "source_id": "520301", "taxonomy_id": 100}], "references": [], "has_linked_file": false, "citation": "Luo, Jian (2026). HS Stroke dataset: an upper-limb motor imagery EEG dataset of chronic stroke patients. figshare. Dataset. https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.30747806.v6", "related_materials": [], "is_embargoed": false, "embargo_date": null, "embargo_type": null, "embargo_title": "", "embargo_reason": "", "embargo_options": [], "id": 30747806, "title": "HS Stroke dataset: an upper-limb motor imagery EEG dataset of chronic stroke patients", "doi": "10.6084/m9.figshare.30747806.v6", "handle": "", "url": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/30747806", "published_date": "2026-07-24T16:16:18Z", "thumb": "https://s3-eu-west-1.amazonaws.com/pfigshare-u-previews/66960068/thumb.png", "defined_type": 3, "defined_type_name": "dataset", "group_id": null, "url_private_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/account/articles/30747806", "url_public_api": "https://api.figshare.com/v2/articles/30747806", "url_private_html": "https://figshare.com/account/articles/30747806", "timeline": {"posted": "2026-07-24T16:16:18", "firstOnline": "2026-04-24"}, "resource_title": null, "resource_doi": null}